// A file with declarations and nothing to run. As a program it has no entry
// point: no `main`, no `@entry` function and no top-level statements, so it
// is E0327 (Entry Points E.1). The same file is a fine member of a library,
// which is why the build, not the checker, reports it (gap 35).

class Unused {
    public int n = 0;
}
